{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/3b5a7ea0db79b2b40cc68b8930f93fc6.avif?t=1760824334\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/2e0b79e94945d33cf06c037e88706d87.avif?t=1760824334\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/d751113ae1df21b78fdfaa35b2bc9833.avif?t=1760824334\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/ae08aaa90ba5b97b374d52ebf327da29.avif?t=1760824334\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/105c7927c7a907b1f27d479705613e3b.avif?t=1760824334\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><br><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25ba Core Experience</strong><br>A strategic masterpiece blending <strong>[Real-Time Battle Command]</strong> with <strong>[In-Depth City Management]</strong>, where you rule as both a visionary monarch and a battlefield warlord:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grand Strategy</strong>: Build a thriving capital from scratch\u2014manage populations, resources, and economic networks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Warfare</strong>: Train multi-tiered armies (infantry/cavalry/archers) and command <strong>2,000 units simultaneously</strong> in large-scale battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroic Mayhem</strong>: Take direct control of legendary generals, unleashing <strong>devastating area skills</strong> to cleave through enemy ranks (e.g., &quot;Blade Tempest&quot; annihilates entire squadrons)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: Press Ctrl+Shift+L to toggle languages during gameplay.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique blend of mythical strategy and epic warfare! In this game based on 'The Investiture of the Gods', you'll play as a heaven-chosen commander - building prosperous cities, training mighty armies, and leading 2,000 soldiers in breathtaking on-screen battles. Develop your economy, expand your territory, and ultimately unify ancient China to write your own legendary tale of deification!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895300?t=1760824334","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895300?t=1760824334","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/1d1ee0fc23644904f081587d9862d6eb75d1f72c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760824334","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/1d1ee0fc23644904f081587d9862d6eb75d1f72c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760824334","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/3b5a7ea0db79b2b40cc68b8930f93fc6.avif?t=1760824334\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/2e0b79e94945d33cf06c037e88706d87.avif?t=1760824334\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_